      "statement": "Relationships have four explicit types (PARENT_CHILD, ADOPTIVE_PARENT_CHILD, SPOUSE, PARTNER); for parent edges person_id is the parent and related_person_id the child, and spouse rows are canonicalized so person_id sorts before related_person_id.",
